WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.930
Near the south pole.

00:02.630 --> 00:13.961
India's first try, Chandrayaan-2, carried a lander also called Vikram, and it crashed in September 2019 about 110 km from here.

00:14.411 --> 00:23.705
This one was built to work for one lunar day, about 14 Earth days, and was put to sleep on 4 September 2023.
